# .claspignore — controls what `clasp push` uploads from apps-script/
# (rootDir, see .clasp.json.example) into the Apps Script project.
#
# Patterns are matched relative to rootDir (apps-script/), gitignore-style.
# Verify the actual push set with `clasp status` before ever running
# `clasp push` — see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
#
# EXCLUDED — one-time infrastructure utilities (SetupDatabase.gs writes to
# the spreadsheet structure, InspectDatabase.gs/DatabaseInspectorStandalone.gs
# belong to the separate, read-only "SIGAP SARPRAS - Database Inspector"
# project and must never ship inside the MVP Web App). Nothing under
# core/, users/, master-data/, reports/, or api/ depends on this folder —
# confirmed by dependency audit, see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
tools/**

# EXCLUDED — manual smoke tests (Logger-based, run from the Apps Script
# editor by a developer). Several of them write TEST_-tagged data or bump
# production sequences when run — they must never be reachable from the
# deployed Web App. Nothing under core/, users/, master-data/, reports/,
# or api/ depends on this folder.
tests/**

# EXCLUDED — documentation. Not a valid Apps Script source file type
# (.gs/.html/.json), and not needed at runtime.
**/*.md
